{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47264","headline":"游仙二十四首 一 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啓册观往载，摇怀考今情。\n终古已寂寂，举世何营营。\n悟彼衆仙妙，超然含至精。\n凝神契冲玄，化服凌太清。\n心同宇宙广，体合云霞轻。\n翔风吹羽盖，庆霄拂霓旌。\n龙驾朝紫微，後天保令名。\n岂如寰中士，轩冕矜蹔荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}